goal_template:
A run just failed in the fleet. Triage it.

Failed agent: {{event.agent_name}} (id: {{event.agent_id}})
Run ID:       {{event.run_id}}
Status:       {{event.status}}
Error:        {{event.error}}

Classify the error, check recurrence over the last 24h, and write exactly one audit note.
If this category has recurred ≥3 times for this agent and no reminder was created in the last 24h, also create a high-priority reminder. Otherwise the note is enough.
